37645>>>    Procedure OnNavigateForward tWebNavigateData NavigateData Integer hoInvokingView Integer hoInvokingObject
37648>>>        WebSet pbRender of oNewButton to True
37649>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to True
37650>>>
37650>>>        Case Begin
37650>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromParent)
37652>>>                // If from parent, this is a constrained drill down
37652>>>                Case Break
37653>>>
37653>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromChild)
37656>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent lookup from a Zoom
37656>>>                Case Break
